  "summary": "Crystal seasons 1-3 (our eps 1-39) adapt the manga strictly 1:1 per Act in the renumbered 60-act space: eps 1-26 = Acts 1-26 (Dark Kingdom Acts 1-13, transition Act 14, Black Moon Acts 15-26), and the Death Busters season's 13 episodes cover Infinity Acts 27-38, with Act 27 uniquely split across eps 27-28 (Part 1/Part 2) and eps 29-39 = Acts 28-38. Every episode title equals its act title on both the fandom wiki and Wikipedia's episode list, and the fandom wiki's episode pages ('Nth episode overall', prev/next chains, 'based on manga chapter Act N') confirm each correspondence. The stored ep39->ch60 v18 anchor was a finale-inflated last-chapter fill and is repaired to Act 38 v10. Numbering conversion: our chapter space (volume boundaries, last chapter 60) uses the renumbered act scheme popularized by the 2003 shinsouban (Act 27 = Infinity 1, Act 60 = Stars 11); the original 1992-97 tankobon instead numbered 52 acts + 9 side stories (= AniList's 61 count, explaining flag #696). Both research sources use the renumbered scheme, so source->our-space conversion is the identity.",
